PRINTFORML V経験+{PLAY}
EXP:(ARG:0):0 += PLAY
PRINTFORMW 獣姦経験+{PLAY}
EXP:(ARG:0):56 += PLAY
CFLAG:(ARG:0):106 += PLAY

